   "source": [
    "# P0035 Tatakua — Air Quality Forecasting\n",
    "\n",
    "Forecast PM2.5 for Asunción using OpenAQ + Sentinel-5P + TimesFM/LSTM.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Target journal:** Atmospheric Environment\n",
    "**Advisors:** Multi (FIA + Lic. Ciencias Atmosféricas)\n",
    "**Timeline:** 8 weeks\n",
    "\n",
    "## Goals\n",
    "\n",
    "- [ ] Pipeline scaffolding ✅\n",
    "- [ ] OpenAQ API client (5 years of data)\n",
    "- [ ] Sentinel-5P atmospheric retrieval\n",
    "- [ ] LSTM training with cross-validation\n",
    "- [ ] Validate MAE < 5 µg/m³\n",
    "- [ ] Generate paper figures\n",
    "\n",
    "## Quick start\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "from src.papers.p0035_tatakua_air_quality import TatakuaPipeline\n",
    "pipeline = TatakuaPipeline()\n",
    "data = pipeline.fetch_openaq_data(days=365)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, '..')\n",
    "\n",
    "from src.utils import set_seed\n",
    "set_seed(42)\n",
    "\n",
    "from src.papers.p0035_tatakua_air_quality import TatakuaPipeline\n",
    "import numpy as np"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "pipeline = TatakuaPipeline()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Fetch OpenAQ\n",
    "data = pipeline.fetch_openaq_data(days=30)\n",
    "print(f\"OpenAQ measurements (30 days): {len(data)}\")\n",
    "\n",
    # Fetch Sentinel-5P\n",
    "s5p = pipeline.fetch_sentinel5p(days=30)\n",
    "print(f\"Sentinel-5P pollutants: {list(s5p.keys())}\")\n",
    "\n",
    # Forecast\n",
    "historical = np.random.rand(30) * 25 + 5  # 5-30 µg/m³ PM2.5\n",
    "forecast = pipeline.forecast_pm25(historical)\n",
    "print(f\"\\nForecast shape: {forecast.shape}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Forecast values: {forecast}\")"
   ]
  }
